    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8e696371-cee9-39e5-993c-09f7d29d8562",
                "word": "fornication",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bc279cbd-e28c-4953-96c6-885f15c3be31",
                        "entry_id": "8e696371-cee9-39e5-993c-09f7d29d8562",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fornications"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                        "entry_id": "8e696371-cee9-39e5-993c-09f7d29d8562",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sexual intercourse by people who are not married to each other, or which is considered illicit in another way."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a56855a3-db66-4995-bac0-105c2afdc79f",
                                "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                                "text": "FRIAR BARNARDINE. Thou hast committed—\nBARABAS. Fornication: but that was in another country;\nAnd besides, the wench is dead."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b68b35a-3838-4a70-ab83-9f0fdb8def0a",
                                "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                                "text": "I am the sister of one Claudio,\nCondemned upon the act of fornication\nTo lose his head, condemned by Angelo"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2245ee02-5325-4c18-94f9-805d7c0f8ca1",
                                "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                                "text": "Now the works of the flesh are manifest, which are these; Adultery, fornication, uncleanness, lasciviousness, Idolatry, witchcraft, hatred, variance, emulations, wrath, strife, seditions, heresies, Envyings, murders, drunkenness, revellings, and such like: of the which I tell you before, as I have also told you in time past, that they which do such things shall not inherit the kingdom of God."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8cb6e05-cae0-4f84-99e8-bc651ec88e9c",
                                "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                                "text": "Draw not near unto fornication; for it is wickedness, and an evil way"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9ecfca0-8677-45c3-9740-4912e9da4fe4",
                                "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                                "text": "In one case, where a man was sued for committing fornication with his wife before marriage, it appeared, that seven years after her death he was cited to stand as a prisoner at their bar, though he had lived with her for nine years,[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af156484-a997-4e9a-b3aa-f0387e06f91b",
                                "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                                "text": "... that he was a married man at the time is a necessary allegation, as the allegation that he was an unmarried man would have been necessary had he been charged with the crime of incest, by having committed fornication with his daughter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d38b8d49-88b5-4e5a-a04d-de646ab3e8aa",
                                "sense_id": "706b5425-a2c4-3e8e-a37d-910fc4321f21",
                                "text": "Thus, at Roxbury, 1678, Hanna Hopkins was censured in the church for fornication with her husband before marriage and for fleeing from justice into Rhode Island."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f847b36e-449e-373d-b2b7-915020b924d6",
                        "entry_id": "8e696371-cee9-39e5-993c-09f7d29d8562",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sexual intercourse in general; sex."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23ff6dbd-864f-4af9-a84a-d0d303c74d46",
                                "sense_id": "f847b36e-449e-373d-b2b7-915020b924d6",
                                "text": "For a moment he stared at the back of the Lascar, wondering if he were the youth that he had disturbed during fornication with his Engineer, then dismissed all thoughts of the previous night, he was getting old, and suspicious, what did it matter […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "942b042e-6e06-4093-8198-1e5a4b26d08c",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e696371-cee9-39e5-993c-09f7d29d8562",
                        "source_sense_description": "sexual intercourse considered illicit",
                        "target_lang_word": "ontucht",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ontucht",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fcb5fe9-dafe-3f8e-a5d4-9587060dd700",
                                        "entry_id": "c0519907-bca3-34db-8967-b89f37bed11a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "seks die tegen de heersende moraal ingaat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fe7af20-b24c-45f2-895f-a2b53d1afa7b",
                                                "sense_id": "8fcb5fe9-dafe-3f8e-a5d4-9587060dd700",
                                                "text": "Er is gisteren een 34-jarige man opgepakt wegens het plegen van ontucht."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "82144b82-87d3-4a4f-9a39-ce511fb14e9a",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e696371-cee9-39e5-993c-09f7d29d8562",
                        "source_sense_description": "sexual intercourse considered illicit",
                        "target_lang_word": "fornication",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fornication",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de9e33b5-8c7c-34ca-94a0-88ac833d4b82",
                                        "entry_id": "405c166f-836b-398d-a927-74383b4d7088",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Péché de la chair, relation sexuelle non approuvée par l'Église."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11b2d719-c1a3-426e-8266-cd0ab6af4889",
                                                "sense_id": "de9e33b5-8c7c-34ca-94a0-88ac833d4b82",
                                                "text": "Tandis que, dans sa conscience, elle se croit coupable pour avoir forniqué avec monsieur Roux, mon élève, je tiens sa fornication pour innocente, comme n’ayant fait de mal à personne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd2dc357-72eb-4e4f-81fc-0827b2fbf082",
                                                "sense_id": "de9e33b5-8c7c-34ca-94a0-88ac833d4b82",
                                                "text": "« Ces mots de… fornicateur et de fornication que tu emploies volontiers ont quelque chose de rude et de déplaisant. Je sais bien qu’ils se trouvent dans le Bible. Malgré tout, nous ne devons les employer qu’avec discernement, comprends-tu ? »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ebf34683-7f1e-3008-812e-c0e57fe8cddb",
                                        "entry_id": "405c166f-836b-398d-a927-74383b4d7088",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fait de s’abandonner à l’idolâtrie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58725663-f10f-4317-8b75-2487698acfc4",
                                                "sense_id": "ebf34683-7f1e-3008-812e-c0e57fe8cddb",
                                                "text": "L’Écriture, toute divine en ses expressions, traite l’idolâtrie, de fornication & de prostitution : cela est bien dit ; puisque l’homme se retire de son légitime possesseur pour se donner à de misérables créatures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d2dcb6b-367a-3d12-88fc-9754113bbe53",
                                        "entry_id": "405c166f-836b-398d-a927-74383b4d7088",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relations sexuelles entre deux personnes libres, non mariées."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc980f1d-31b4-49e3-86de-553c9f03cfa4",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2dcb6b-367a-3d12-88fc-9754113bbe53",
                                                "text": "En province, […], toute fille qui devient amante « fait une faute » ; le terme est significatif. […]. Si elle est institutrice, on la dénonce, car la fornication est un péché mortel, même chez les anticléricaux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28c0bfa7-96d1-3e64-85e0-63385f2f23ff",
                                        "entry_id": "405c166f-836b-398d-a927-74383b4d7088",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rapports sexuels en général."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e5f48a7-d052-4223-b43d-6e374f2001d5",
                                                "sense_id": "28c0bfa7-96d1-3e64-85e0-63385f2f23ff",
                                                "text": "Outrée déjà d’un si grand nombre de fornications involontaires, tout son fiel se répandit à l’aspect du monceau de ruines que son ménage était devenu, et il ne lui fut que trop facile de livrer au démon de la vengeance l’âme ulcérée de son époux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "287e0f63-eac0-42f3-b21c-1e8e133983e5",
                                                "sense_id": "28c0bfa7-96d1-3e64-85e0-63385f2f23ff",
                                                "text": "Elle était vierge de corps seulement. Même quand le robuste travailleur de la glaise l’eut initié aux délicats titillements de la fornication sans apprêts, il ne parut pas qu’elle eût gagné ou perdu à l’opération."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bef8f53-21ef-49a0-ab35-292c4c9e188f",
                                                "sense_id": "28c0bfa7-96d1-3e64-85e0-63385f2f23ff",
                                                "text": "Manquant à la pudeur la plus élémentaire,\nDois-je, pour les besoins d’ la caus’ publicitaire,\nDivulguer avec qui, et dans quell’ position\nJe plonge dans le stupre et la fornication ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02461ac8-35f5-4b9b-962a-c7620694fb93",
                                                "sense_id": "28c0bfa7-96d1-3e64-85e0-63385f2f23ff",
                                                "text": "Nous sommes de la génération de transition, qui se croyait dégagée des tabous, mais ne saurait comme certains membres de la nouvelle considérer l’amour, ci-devant dénommé fornication, comme l’expression même de l’innocence et de la liberté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd7bb509-6ffb-4eb5-95f5-2aeb075ec051",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e696371-cee9-39e5-993c-09f7d29d8562",
                        "source_sense_description": "sexual intercourse considered illicit",
                        "target_lang_word": "Unzucht",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Unzucht",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99f85fdc-daca-36c1-bf96-2b53db476bb6",
                                        "entry_id": "367c8bc1-c468-37bc-ad5b-feb6f7dd9e6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sexuelles Verhalten, das gegen das sittliche Empfinden einer Gesellschaft verstößt; illegitimer Geschlechtsverkehr"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df80b7dc-6c54-47f3-bb1d-c393b8694121",
                                                "sense_id": "99f85fdc-daca-36c1-bf96-2b53db476bb6",
                                                "text": "Weil sie so offen ihre Unzucht trieb und ihre Scham entblößte, wandte auch ich mich jäh von ihr ab, wie ich mich von ihrer Schwester abgewandt hatte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d71fe55a-bcc3-4cc5-a37d-dcfb0cc418b5",
                                                "sense_id": "99f85fdc-daca-36c1-bf96-2b53db476bb6",
                                                "text": "Im Jahre 1912 wurde der Maler Egon Schiele in Wien verhaftet. Man warf ihm vor, er treibe Unzucht mit Kindern und produziere Pornographie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4e05ef2-1365-461e-abfb-dddd7e169651",
                                                "sense_id": "99f85fdc-daca-36c1-bf96-2b53db476bb6",
                                                "text": "„Die Unzucht zwischen den Bäumen war jedenfalls berüchtigt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48da4a60-8c09-4154-8bba-c3e054d7ac02",
                                                "sense_id": "99f85fdc-daca-36c1-bf96-2b53db476bb6",
                                                "text": "„Sie nahm also das Verzeichnis der Todsünden in ihre königlichen Hände, fand ihrer sieben und beschloß, daß sie sechs übersehen könne; die Unzucht aber erschien ihr unverzeihlich, und gegen diese wandte sich ihr Eifer und überschlug sich.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
